ffectiveness.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:3567","label":"Design, implement, and monitor the development of mines, facilities, systems, or equipment.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:3568","label":"Select or develop mineral location, extraction, and production methods, based on factors such as safety, cost, and deposit characteristics.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:3569","label":"Prepare technical reports for use by mining, engineering, and management personnel.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:3570","label":"Implement and coordinate mine safety programs, including the design and maintenance of protective and rescue equipment and safety devices.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:3571","label":"Test air to detect toxic gases and recommend measures to remove them, such as installation of ventilation shafts.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:3572","label":"Design, develop, and implement computer applications for use in mining operations such as mine design, modeling, or mapping or for monitoring mine conditions.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:3573","label":"Select or devise materials-handling methods and equipment to transport ore, waste materials, and mineral products efficiently and economically.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:3574","label":"Devise solutions to problems of land reclamation and water and air pollution, such as methods of storing excavated soil and returning exhausted mine sites to natural states.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:3575","label":"Lay out, direct, and supervise mine construction operations, such as the construction of shafts and tunnels.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:3576","label":"E